---
const brand = "HireReady";
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy and Resume Data | {brand}</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 760px; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0 20px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1f2937; }
      a { color: #2563eb; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p><a href="/">&larr; {brand}</a></p>
    <h1>Privacy and Resume Data</h1>

    <h2>Free tools</h2>
    <p>The Free Resume Builder and the Job Description Matcher run in your browser. The text you type is not uploaded or saved by us.</p>

    <h2>Paid ATS resume analysis</h2>
    <p><b>What we receive:</b> the resume you send us, and your payment screenshot.</p>
    <p><b>How we use it:</b> only to prepare your analysis and to confirm your payment.</p>
    <p><b>Sharing:</b> we do not sell your resume or share it with employers or other companies.</p>
    <p><b>Deletion:</b> we delete your resume and screenshot within 30 days of delivering your report. You can ask us to delete them sooner by messaging us on WhatsApp.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions or deletion requests: WhatsApp +91 96635 19674.</p>
  </body>
</html>